 "summary": "A single white surface-mount LED in a 0603 body, 1.6 by 0.8 mm and 0.6 mm tall, under a flat yellow lens. At 5 mA it gives 145 to 360 mcd over a 120° viewing angle at a forward voltage of 2.6 to 3.1 V, with a typical CIE 1931 colour point of x = 0.232, y = 0.2. It takes up to 30 mA continuous and 5 V reverse, is sorted into intensity, voltage and colour bins, and ships 4000 to a reel of 8 mm tape for infrared reflow assembly.",
